    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26055" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατήκω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>melt, soften by heat,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					149
				</span></i>
			; <i>relax</i> the bowels, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>soak,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἐλαίῳ</span>”
