					Thphr.
					<u>Od.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				15.13
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ετήχθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					<u>Bel.</u>
					89.20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
