				<u>An.</u>
				4.5.6
			</span></i>; <i>waste away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				385a28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				2.14
			</span></i>.</div>
